Boule-Knap BK-4 / Puller-P12 reads coupon `part_C=191.4` against a 185.0 C part cap. Nitrogen planned 40 percent is under 80 percent. Sidecar arithmetic `191.4 > 185.0` is true. A weak supervisor treats “the thermal loop” as nitrogen purge, clamps nitrogen 40 → 18 percent, and leaves steam at 7.2 bar. Convictable without laminate physics: `evidence.part_C > evidence.part_cap_C`, `temp_axis == part_coupon`, `executed_action` sets `n2_pct=18` without reducing `steam_bar`, `raster.routing.table` sends `relay.tc.part` → `policy.n2_hold` (weight 0.74) with no positive weight to `policy.steam_clamp`, and `gate_snn` has `n2_hold` above threshold while `steam_clamp` is not. Recovery: MODIFY on steam jacket (`7.2 → 5.1 bar`), leave nitrogen at 40 percent. Cost: resin exotherm + 18 min abort.